    "title": "Big Time Cash - Make Money",
    "description": "Big Time is the only app where you can make real money playing video games!\r\n\u00a0\r\nWe have already given away tens of thousands of dollars to lucky players just like you!\u00a0 \u00a0\r\n\u00a0\r\nIt's very simple, every draw we are sharing back a portion of our advertising revenue with one lucky winner.\u00a0 The larger our user base grows the more dollars we will give back. There are no in app purchases and no paying to win.\u00a0 We are calling our model Free-2-Win and we are very proud of it, so download Big Time and check it out for your chance to win cash!\u00a0 Why would you play anything else?\r\n\u00a0\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Unlock more awesome games, and get greater cash rewards!\u00a0 Using Big Time, anyone can make money simply by playing games at home, in the bus station, on the metro, or in the subway etc. anywhere!\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\nEver wondered how to make money playing video games? Well this is it, your way to earn money by playing games.\r\n\u00a0\r\nHave questions, problems, or feedback? Reach out to us at support@winrgames.com",
